  "name": "medium-stp-off-power-loss-primary",
  "lab": "Medium lab",
  "title": "MLAG primary power loss \u00b7 Medium lab, all bridges STP off",
  "action": "Resets all three bridges over management SSH with protocol-mode=none. It requires a loss-free probe baseline, zero BPDUs and one copy of each broadcast. It then emulates a power loss of CHR 1 (MLAG primary, mlag-priority=10): in one step it takes the container veths behind CHR 1's ether2 to ether4 down, sets the facing NICs of CHR 2 and the access switch link-down over QMP and pauses CHR 1's guest with QMP stop, then confirms carrier loss at every neighbour. After 20 s it powers CHR 1 on with QMP system_reset and cont, brings the links back up, waits for the guest uptime to reset and keeps probing for 16 s plus a 3 s recovery window.",
